    "content": {
      "value": "**UPDATE**\n==========\n\nThe price books to follow what is currently managed by Zimmermann:\n\n![image-20260910-055818.png](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/292388871/child/attachment/att491389000/download)\n\n1. Overview\n-----------\n\nPricing in the Zimmermann SFCC platform is managed through a per-site, per-currency **pricebook** structure. Each site has a list price (RRP) and a sale price pricebook for each currency it supports. For Global-e sites (USIntl, EUIntl, ME, HK), SFCC holds prices in the base currency; Global-e handles currency conversion and localisation at checkout.\n\nThere is no direct MuleSoft price integration. Price feeds are expected to originate from **AP21** and are loaded into SFCC via data import (XML pricebooks).\n\n---\n\n2. Pricebook Architecture\n-------------------------\n\n### 2.1 Naming Convention\n\nnonewide760{site}-{currency}-list-prices ← RRP / list price\n{site}-{currency}-sale-prices ← Sale price (parent = list pricebook)\n\n**Examples:**`au-aud-list-prices`, `au-aud-sale-prices`, `usintl-usd-list-prices`, `euintl-eur-list-prices`\n\n### 2.2 Pricebook Hierarchy\n\nSale pricebooks reference their parent list pricebook:\n\nxmlwide760<header pricebook-id=\"au-aud-sale-prices\">\n<currency>AUD</currency>\n<parent>au-aud-list-prices</parent>\n</header>\n\nSFCC resolves the effective price by checking the sale pricebook first, then falling back to list.\n\n---\n\n3. Pricebook Register — All Sites\n---------------------------------\n\n### ZimmermannAU\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `au-aud-list-prices` | AUD | List |\n| `au-aud-sale-prices` | AUD | Sale |\n\n### ZimmermannUK\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `uk-gbp-list-prices` | GBP | List |\n| `uk-gbp-sale-prices` | GBP | Sale |\n\n### ZimmermannUS (domestic)\n\nUSD only. International orders from the US storefront are handled by ZimmermannUSIntl via Global-e.\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `us-usd-list-prices` | USD | List |\n| `us-usd-sale-prices` | USD | Sale |\n\n### ZimmermannUSIntl (Global-e)\n\nBase currency: **USD**. Global-e handles checkout currency conversion; MXN is a supported Global-e display currency for this site.\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `usintl-usd-list-prices` | USD | List |\n| `usintl-usd-sale-prices` | USD | Sale |\n| `usintl-mxn-list-prices` | MXN | List |\n| `usintl-mxn-sale-prices` | MXN | Sale |\n\n### ZimmermannEU\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `eu-eur-list-prices` | EUR | List |\n| `eu-eur-sale-prices` | EUR | Sale |\n\n### ZimmermannEUIntl (Global-e — 18 currencies)\n\nBase currency: **EUR**. Full currency list: EUR, GBP, CHF, ALL, AMD, AZN, BAM, DKK, FKP, GEL, ISK, MDL, MKD, NOK, RSD, SHP, SRD, XCD\n\n| Pattern | Count |\n| --- | --- |\n| `euintl-{currency}-list-prices` | 18 pricebooks |\n| `euintl-{currency}-sale-prices` | 18 pricebooks |\n\n### ZimmermannHK (Global-e)\n\nBase currency: **USD**. HKD, CNY, SGD, THB are Global-e display currencies.\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `hk-usd-list-prices` | USD | List |\n| `hk-usd-sale-prices` | USD | Sale |\n| `hk-cny-list-prices` | CNY | List |\n| `hk-cny-sale-prices` | CNY | Sale |\n| `hk-sgd-list-prices` | SGD | List |\n| `hk-sgd-sale-prices` | SGD | Sale |\n| `hk-thb-list-prices` | THB | List |\n| `hk-thb-sale-prices` | THB | Sale |\n\n### ZimmermannME (Global-e)\n\nBase currency: **EUR**. AED, BHD, SAR, KWD are Global-e display currencies.\n\n| Pricebook | Currency | Type |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `me-eur-list-prices` | EUR | List |\n| `me-eur-sale-prices` | EUR | Sale |\n| `me-aed-list-prices` | AED | List |\n| `me-aed-sale-prices` | AED | Sale |\n| `me-bhd-list-prices` | BHD | List |\n| `me-bhd-sale-prices` | BHD | Sale |\n| `me-sar-list-prices` | SAR | List |\n| `me-sar-sale-prices` | SAR | Sale |\n| `me-kwd-list-prices` | KWD | List |\n| `me-kwd-sale-prices` | KWD | Sale |\n\n**Total: 68 pricebooks across all 8 sites.**\n\n---\n\n4. SFCC Site Configuration\n--------------------------\n\nEach site's active pricebooks are set in `preferences.xml` (`SitePriceBooks`):\n\nxmlwide760<preference preference-id=\"SitePriceBooks\">\nau-aud-list-prices:au-aud-sale-prices\n</preference>\n\nFor Global-e sites, all supported currency pricebooks are listed colon-separated. SFCC loads the appropriate pricebook based on the customer's active currency (set by Global-e).\n\n---\n\n5. Price Feed Integration (AP21 → SFCC)\n---------------------------------------\n\n| Aspect | Detail |\n| --- | --- |\n| Source | AP21 (ERP) |\n| Format | SFCC Pricebook XML (`pricebook.xsd`) |\n| Delivery | [To be confirmed: SFTP drop / API / MuleSoft] |\n| Frequency | [To be confirmed: daily / on product update] |\n| Import method | `sfcc-ci instance:import` or Business Manager Site Import |\n\n**Pricebook XML structure:**\n\nxmlwide760<pricebook xmlns=\"http://www.demandware.com/xml/impex/pricebook/2006-10-31\"\npricebook-id=\"au-aud-list-prices\">\n<header>\n<currency>AUD</currency>\n<display-name xml:lang=\"x-default\">List Prices</display-name>\n<online-flag>true</online-flag>\n</header>\n<price-tables>\n<price-table product-id=\"25565671M\">\n<amount quantity=\"1\">350.00</amount>\n</price-table>\n...\n</price-tables>\n</pricebook>\n\n---\n\n6. Global-e Pricing Model\n-------------------------\n\nFor the four Global-e sites (USIntl, EUIntl, HK, ME):\n\n| Site | SFCC Base Currency | Global-e Display Currencies |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ZimmermannUSIntl | USD | MXN (and others via Global-e FX) |\n| ZimmermannEUIntl | EUR | GBP, CHF, ALL, AMD, AZN, BAM, DKK, FKP, GEL, ISK, MDL, MKD, NOK, RSD, SHP, SRD, XCD |\n| ZimmermannHK | USD | HKD, CNY, SGD, THB |\n| ZimmermannME | EUR | AED, BHD, SAR, KWD |\n\nSFCC loads the pricebook matching the currency Global-e sends in the session. Global-e portal rebranding is **out of scope** for this replatform.\n\n---\n\n7. Key Design Decisions\n-----------------------\n\n| Decision | Choice | Rationale |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pricebook naming | `{site}-{currency}-list/sale-prices` | Site-scoped; prevents currency sharing across sites with different price points |\n| Sale pricebook parent | `<parent>` tag referencing list pricebook | Correct SFCC schema (`parent-pricebook` is invalid per pricebook.xsd) |\n| US domestic vs USIntl split | Separate sites | Domestic US (USD only) vs Global-e international (USD + MXN) have different pricing, inventory, and checkout flows |\n| MXN pricebooks | Assigned to USIntl, not US domestic | MXN is a Global-e display currency for international visitors; domestic US checkout is USD only |\n| HK base currency | USD | Global-e transacts in USD for the HK site; HKD/CNY/SGD/THB are display-only |\n| ME base currency | EUR | Global-e transacts in EUR for the ME site; AED/BHD/SAR/KWD are display-only |\n| USIntl base currency | USD | Global-e transacts in USD; MXN is a display-only currency |\n| 68 total pricebooks | Per-site per-currency | Enables independent pricing and promotion strategy per market |\n\n---\n\n8. Open Items\n-------------\n\n| # | Item | Owner |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Confirm price feed mechanism from AP21 to SFCC (SFTP, API, or MuleSoft) | Integration Lead / Zimmermann IT |\n| 2 | Confirm price update frequency (full reload vs delta) | Zimmermann Finance |\n| 3 | Define sale price strategy — SFCC promotions vs separate sale pricebook | Zimmermann Merch |\n| 4 | Confirm whether Global-e pricebook entries are manually maintained or AP21-fed | Integration Lead |",
